    "name": "Festival International du Raï d'Oujda",
    "id": "international-rai-festival-oujda",
    "description": "Festival International du Raï, launched in 2007 in Oujda by the Association Oujda Arts under royal patronage, gathers Moroccan and international raï artists for open-air concerts near the city's Stade d'Honneur. It went on hiatus after its 2020 edition was cancelled for COVID-19 and returned in 2025.",
